OL,3,GNEWSAReform defector reveals she voted
OL,4,ARemain in Brexit vote and wants Welsh
OL,5,Aindependence
OL,6,
OL,7,FHer defection - which came on the same
OL,8,Fday Dan Thomas stepped down as Reform's
OL,9,FWelsh leader - means Plaid now has 44
OL,10,Fmembers in Cardiff Bay, and Reform as
OL,11,Fthe largest opposition party has 33
OL,12,Fseats.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
